==== simple modal lan
h4: High Availability - General
lan.interface [CBI.ListValue] Interface: select=lan {backend,lan}
lan.address [CBI.Value] Virtual IP Address (IPv4): value=192.168.50.254 (placeholder "192.168.1.254")
  help: Optional. You can configure IPv4 only, IPv6 only, or both (dual-stack).
lan.netmask [CBI.Value] Netmask: value=255.255.255.0 (placeholder "255.255.255.0")
lan.address6 [CBI.Value] Virtual IP Address (IPv6): value=fd00:192:168:50::254 (placeholder "fd00::1")
  help: Optional. Multicast VRRP advertises it in a second instance with VRID+128; unicast VRRP fails it over with the single instance.
lan.prefix6 [CBI.Value] IPv6 Prefix Length: value=64 (placeholder "64")
lan.enabled [CBI.FlagValue] Enable: [x]
<button> Dismiss
<button> Save
