==== owsync-advanced
h2: High Availability - Advanced Config Sync
<alert> Install the owsync package to synchronize configuration files.
==== lease-sync-advanced
h2: High Availability - Advanced Lease Sync
<alert> Install the lease-sync and dnsmasq-ha packages to enable real-time DHCP lease synchronization.
